LiquidAI d1 text compatibility and optional reference
----------------------------------------------------
The text prompt/readout compatibility in app/studio/runtime/d1_reference.py,
reused by the native CUDA and managed System One adapters, is adapted from
LiquidAI/d1-2B prompt.py and api.py at revision
 a6bce774e6dde338dcc3036ceb5d91f78bf4c19e, with a modified text-only API and
independent local weight loading. The optional PyTorch reference remains
separate from native serving.
Source: https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/d1-2B
