This license has a commercial annual-revenue threshold; it is not Apache-2.0.
The LFM3 operator reference follows HuggingFace's modeling_lfm3.py carried in
that snapshot. Copyright 2026 The HuggingFace Team. All rights reserved.
License: Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE).
