ggml-org/llama.cpp,
based on commit 25a1d63f4346b472e508c6dbd9ab2ed1d81ace2e, with TyloInfer-specific
modifications.

Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors
License: MIT (`LICENSES/llama.cpp-MIT.txt`)
