Splash
------
The ancestor-query transform and recurrent scan in the Flash-Next Gated
DeltaNet verification kernel are adapted from Splash's
`gdn_decode_prologue`, `gdn_decode_transform`, `gdn_decode_scan`,
`gdn_decode_gate` and `gdn_fold_rows`. Flash-Next
PLE also adapts its tree convolution and retained history from
`runtime/metal/kernels/shared/ngram_embedding.metal`.
The greedy DFlash2 tree growth and history lookup priors also adapt
`runtime/metal/kernels/decode/sampling.metal` and `runtime/model/LookupProposals.hpp`.
Packed row allocation adapts `runtime/model/StepCosts.cpp`.
License: Apache-2.0 (`LICENSE`)
Source: https://github.com/incoai/splash
Reference: release 1.7.0, runtime/metal/kernels/decode/gdn.metal

